1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,625
A lazy river, fourteen restaurants, and a Strip view from your suite, all inside one Las Vegas hotel.

2
00:00:07,675 --> 00:00:13,849
This is the MGM Grand, and it is made for a Vegas trip with friends, or a big night out for two.

3
00:00:13,899 --> 00:00:17,195
A full-service spa, a gym, and a sportsbook, all on the property.

4
00:00:17,245 --> 00:00:23,247
Here is how I would plan your stay, and my honest score comes at the end.

5
00:00:23,297 --> 00:00:24,607
Start with the pool.

6
00:00:24,657 --> 00:00:30,010
Four hundred sixty-eight guest reviews single out the pool area and the lazy river.

7
00:00:30,060 --> 00:00:34,269
There are three hot tubs too, plus a sauna and a steam room.

8
00:00:34,319 --> 00:00:38,660
That makes a full day of relaxing, right where you sleep.

9
00:00:38,710 --> 00:00:39,953
Now, dinner.

10
00:00:40,003 --> 00:00:45,884
The MGM Grand has fourteen restaurants, ten bars and lounges, and two coffee shops.

11
00:00:45,934 --> 00:00:51,842
Expedia lists Craftsteak, Emeril's, Morimoto, Luchini, and Wolfgang Puck Bar and Grill.

12
00:00:51,892 --> 00:00:59,398
The hotel also has Joël Robuchon, a French restaurant with three Michelin stars, so check its open days and book ahead.

13
00:00:59,448 --> 00:01:04,062
Guests love the variety: five hundred thirty-six reviews praise the food choices.

14
00:01:04,112 --> 00:01:07,163
There is a buffet too, and TAP Sports Bar for game day.

15
00:01:07,213 --> 00:01:10,703
Breakfast is cooked to order, served from six to one.

16
00:01:10,753 --> 00:01:12,022
Now, where you sleep.

17
00:01:12,073 --> 00:01:16,783
Rooms have premium bedding, a separate sitting area, and a fifty-five inch TV.

18
00:01:16,832 --> 00:01:21,178
Many suites have a living room, and many look out over the Strip.

19
00:01:21,228 --> 00:01:25,043
The Skyloft suites go even bigger, with two floors.

20
00:01:25,093 --> 00:01:27,225
Bathrooms come with free toiletries.

21
00:01:27,275 --> 00:01:30,796
One suite even has its own billiards table.

22
00:01:30,846 --> 00:01:32,433
Then, the fun part.

23
00:01:32,483 --> 00:01:38,186
The casino has two thousand five hundred slot machines and two hundred gaming tables.

24
00:01:38,237 --> 00:01:41,115
There is a sportsbook, and golf on the property too.

25
00:01:41,165 --> 00:01:46,445
The spa offers aromatherapy, hot stone massage, and body wraps.

26
00:01:46,495 --> 00:01:52,356
The hotel also has seventy meeting rooms, so it works well for group trips and events.

27
00:01:52,406 --> 00:01:54,083
A few things to know before you go.

28
00:01:54,133 --> 00:01:57,121
There is a resort fee, so check what it covers.

29
00:01:57,171 --> 00:02:02,078
Parking is twenty dollars a day if you park yourself, and forty with valet.

30
00:02:02,128 --> 00:02:06,758
Check-in starts at three in the afternoon, and you must be twenty-one to book.

31
00:02:06,808 --> 00:02:13,333
The outdoor pool is seasonal, so check it is open for your dates, and cabanas cost extra.

32
00:02:13,383 --> 00:02:15,862
So, is the MGM Grand worth it?

33
00:02:15,912 --> 00:02:22,277
On Expedia, guests give it eight point four out of ten, from more than twenty-three thousand verified reviews.

34
00:02:22,327 --> 00:02:26,081
Cleanliness scores eight point eight, and staff and service eight point four.

35
00:02:26,131 --> 00:02:27,463
My honest score is eight out of ten.

36
00:02:27,513 --> 00:02:34,417
It is a great fit for groups and couples who want a big pool day, great dinners, and the Strip at their door.

37
00:02:34,468 --> 00:02:37,144
The link is in the description.
